      "sourceTextSha256": "2a0187072c7769f508b5e6acc990c1fe9907b2e7084da8a968c289fdcc90abfe",
      "text": "Day 5 · A walk of about 3 hours in the El Ángel Ecological Reserve (15,715 ha), where giant frailejones, up to 6 m tall, cover most of the páramo; look for condors, Andean caracaras and gulls, blue-winged teals, foxes and deer. Transfer to a beautiful historic hacienda. Overnight at Hacienda Cusín. (B)",
